      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.02 (vs ₹0.15 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.02 (down from ₹0.15 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹30.6m (down 95% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.17m (down 85% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.8% (up from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 19% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
